────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Keys: Ops                                                                                          
                                                                                                    
  j k ↑ ↓     Move                                                                                  
  g G         Newest, oldest                                                                        
  enter       Open the output, with the CLI command at the top                                      
                                                                                                    
  1 2 5       Home, Stacks, Ops log                                                                 
  U           Bring the whole profile up (lab up)                                                   
  :           Command palette: up, down, status, doctor, plan                                       
  K           Open k9s on the lab cluster; quit it to come back                                     
  ?           This help                                                                             
  q  ctrl+c   Quit                                                                                  
                                                                                                    
  Only one operation runs at a time; other action keys say busy.                                    
  A TUI opened while another lab changes things is read-only: views and                             
  reports work, actions do not, until the other lab is done.                                        
  Every action shows its CLI command in the ops strip.                                              
                                                                                                    
  State: ● healthy  ◐ progressing  ○ off  ✕ failed                                                  
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
